cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  codehound: A Zero-Dependency AST Static Analyzer for
  Concurrency and Resource-Management Defects in Python
  AI/ML Frameworks
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
